[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4909145600","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373#issuecomment-4909145600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373","id":4909145600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABJJueAA","user":{"login":"buraglio","id":1022458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjI0NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1022458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio","html_url":"https://github.com/buraglio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T21:21:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T21:21:28Z","body":"OK, that's good that I am not the only one seeing this behavior. Like I said, I am pretty certain it's the TS client, and I will follow up with the TS folks as well as soon as I can figure out how to reproduce it without headscale (which I can't seem to do for some reason). Would be interested in others experiences or input. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4909145600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4911810995","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373#issuecomment-4911810995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373","id":4911810995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABJMRJsw","user":{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T05:57:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T05:57:52Z","body":"> I can figure out how to reproduce it without headscale (which I can't seem to do for some reason).\n\nThe client has a DNS fallback to its control plane/DERP baked in (see https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale/blob/887005d25566ae97aaec23137d7e84e8f2e01862/net/dnsfallback/dnsfallback.go#L220 and https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale/blob/main/net/dnsfallback/dns-fallback-servers.json). Maybe this fallback mechanism comes into play?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4911810995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4913653076","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373#issuecomment-4913653076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373","id":4913653076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABJOBlVA","user":{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T10:03:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T10:03:53Z","body":"(Deleted commit with malware attached to it)","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4913653076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4917442439","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373#issuecomment-4917442439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3373","id":4917442439,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABJRo3hw","user":{"login":"buraglio","id":1022458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjI0NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1022458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio","html_url":"https://github.com/buraglio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buraglio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T17:26:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T17:26:53Z","body":"This is likely at least part of the problem: \n\n```\n  for (len(cands4) > 0 || len(cands6) > 0) && len(cands) < maxCands {\n      if len(cands4) > 0 {\n          cands = append(cands, cands4[0])   // IPv4 appended first\n          cands4 = cands4[1:]\n      }\n      if len(cands6) > 0 {\n          cands = append(cands, cands6[0])   // IPv6 appended second\n          cands6 = cands6[1:]\n      }\n  }\n```\nThis looks like it iterates through a candidate list as v4, v6, v4, v6, ... but stops at the first success, which is likely a problem for NAT64 clients. Swapping the order would probably go a long way on hosts without IPv4 even with a NAT64 or a CLAT and should force native IPv6 and then stop. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4917442439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/492995755